; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#rir-monitoring-event-report)
; AVP: Monitoring-Event-Report
; Command: Reporting-Information-Request
; Section: 5.2.1
; Table: 5.2.1-1
; Page: 12
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"If the Reporting-Information-Request is sent for reporting the monitoring events, the MME/SGSN and the IWK-SCEF shall include the monitoring event(s) reported towards the SCEF."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#ria-experimental-result-vendor)
; AVP: Experimental-Result
; Command: Reporting-Information-Answer
; Section: 5.2.1
; Table: 5.2.1-2
; Page: 12
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"Experimental-Result AVP shall be used for T6a/b errors. This is a grouped AVP, which contains the 3GPP Vendor ID in the Vendor-Id AVP, and the error code in the Experimental-Result-Code AVP."
    requires Experimental-Result/Vendor-Id = 10415


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#rir-monitoring-event-report-identities)
; AVP: Monitoring-Event-Report
; Command: Reporting-Information-Request
; Section: 5.2.2.0
; Page: 13
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"For all monitoring events, the SCEF-ID, the SCEF-Reference-ID/SCEF-Reference-ID-Ext and the Monitoring-Type AVPs shall be included."
    requires Monitoring-Event-Report/SCEF-ID and Monitoring-Event-Report/Monitoring-Type


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#rir-user-identifier)
; AVP: User-Identifier
; Command: Reporting-Information-Request
; Section: 5.2.2.0
; Page: 13
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"The MME/SGSN shall include the External-Identifier or the MSISDN if present in the subscription data received from the HSS."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#reachability-information-event)
; AVP: Reachability-Information
; Within: Monitoring-Event-Report
; Section: 5.2.2.2
; Page: 14
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"The following AVPs shall be present within the Monitoring-Event-Report AVP when the UE Reachability event is reported:"
"- Monitoring-Type set to either UE_REACHABILITY (1) or UE_REACHABILITY_AND_IDLE_STATUS_INDICATION (8), as received in the configuration request."
"- Reachability-Information set to REACHABLE_FOR_DATA(1)"
"NOTE: When the Monitoring-Type is UE_REACHABILITY_AND_IDLE_STATUS_INDICATION (8), absence of the Idle-Status-Indication AVP from the Monitoring-Event-Report AVP indicates that UE reachability is reported."
    present-if Monitoring-Type = UE_REACHABILITY or Monitoring-Type = UE_REACHABILITY_AND_IDLE_STATUS_INDICATION and not Idle-Status-Indication
    values 1 if Monitoring-Type = UE_REACHABILITY or Monitoring-Type = UE_REACHABILITY_AND_IDLE_STATUS_INDICATION and not Idle-Status-Indication


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#eps-location-information-event)
; AVP: EPS-Location-Information
; Within: Monitoring-Event-Report
; Section: 5.2.2.3
; Page: 14
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"The following AVPs shall be present within the Monitoring-Event-Report AVP when the location event is reported:"
"- Monitoring-Type set to LOCATION_REPORTING (2)"
"- EPS-Location-Information"
    present-if Monitoring-Type = LOCATION_REPORTING


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#communication-failure-information-event)
; AVP: Communication-Failure-Information
; Within: Monitoring-Event-Report
; Section: 5.2.2.4
; Page: 14
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"The following AVPs shall be present within the Monitoring-Event-Report AVP when the Communication Failure event is reported"
"- Monitoring-Type set to COMMUNICATION_FAILURE (5)"
"- Communication-Failure-Information (see clause 6.4.3)"
    present-if Monitoring-Type = COMMUNICATION_FAILURE


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#pdn-connectivity-status-report-event)
; AVP: PDN-Connectivity-Status-Report
; Within: Monitoring-Event-Report
; Section: 5.2.2.7
; Page: 15
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"- Monitoring-Type set to PDN_CONNECTIVITY_STATUS (8)"
"- PDN-Connectivity-Status-Report"
    text-only


