"This Information Element shall be present when the request conveys Non-IP data."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#tda-experimental-result-vendor)
; AVP: Experimental-Result
; Command: MT-Data-Answer
; Section: 5.6.1
; Table: 5.6.1-2
; Page: 21
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"The Experimental-Result AVP shall be used for T6a/b errors. This is a grouped AVP, which contains the 3GPP Vendor ID in the Vendor-Id AVP, and the error code in the Experimental-Result-Code AVP."
    requires Experimental-Result/Vendor-Id = 10415


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#tda-requested-retransmission-time)
; AVP: Requested-Retransmission-Time
; Command: MT-Data-Answer
; Section: 5.6.1
; Table: 5.6.1-2
; Page: 21
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"The Requested Retransmission Time shall not exceed the Maximum Retransmission Time received from the SCEF."
    text-only


; Type: Information Elements
; Command: Connection-Management-Request
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-1
; Page: 23
; Columns: Name                                            AVP                             Cat
"User Identity (See 6.4.16)"                               User-Identifier                 M
"EPS Bearer Identity (See 6.4.17)"                         Bearer-Identifier               M
"T6a/b Connection Action (See 6.4.18)"                     Connection-Action               M
"APN (See 6.4.20)"                                         Service-Selection               C
"Serving PLMN Rate Control (See 6.4.21)"                   Serving-PLMN-Rate-Control       O
"CMR Flags (See 6.4.25)"                                   CMR-Flags                       O
"Maximum UE Availability Time (See 3GPP TS 29.338 [27])"   Maximum-UE-Availability-Time    O
"Extended PCO"                                             Extended-PCO                    C
"3GPP Charging Characteristics (See 3GPP TS 32.298 [30]"   3GPP-Charging-Characteristics   C
"RAT-Type (See 3GPP TS 29.212 [10])"                       RAT-Type                        C
"Supported Features (See 3GPP TS 29.229 [4])"              Supported-Features              O
"Terminal Information (See 3GPP TS 29.272 [16])"           Terminal-Information            C
"Visited PLMN ID (See 3GPP TS 29.272 [16])"                Visited-PLMN-Id                 C
"APN Rate Control Status (see 6.4.36)"                     APN-Rate-Control-Status         O


; Type: Information Elements
; Command: Connection-Management-Answer
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-2
; Page: 23
; Columns: Name                                        AVP                               Cat
"Result (See 6.3)"                                     Result-Code/Experimental-Result   M
"NIDD Charging Identifier (See 3GPP TS 32.299 [22])"   PDN-Connection-Charging-Id        C
"Extended PCO"                                         Extended-PCO                      C
"Supported Features (See 3GPP TS 29.229 [4])"          Supported-Features                O
"APN Rate Control Status (see 6.4.36)"                 APN-Rate-Control-Status           O


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#cmr-user-identifier-imsi)
; AVP: User-Identifier
; Command: Connection-Management-Request
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-1
; Page: 23
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"This Information Element shall be present and shall contain the identity of the UE. This is a grouped AVP which shall contain the IMSI."
    requires User-Identifier/User-Name


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#cmr-service-selection)
; AVP: Service-Selection
; Command: Connection-Management-Request
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-1
; Page: 23
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present if the request is for a T6a/b connection establishment."
    present-if Connection-Action = CONNECTION_ESTABLISHMENT


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#cmr-extended-pco)
; AVP: Extended-PCO
; Command: Connection-Management-Request
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-1
; Page: 23
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"This Information Element shall be present, if the MME or SGSN receives Extended PCO information from the UE."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#cmr-3gpp-charging-characteristics)
; AVP: 3GPP-Charging-Characteristics
; Command: Connection-Management-Request
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-1
; Page: 23
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present if the request is for a T6a/b connection establishment and may be present if the request is for a T6a/b connection update."
    present-if Connection-Action = CONNECTION_ESTABLISHMENT


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#cmr-rat-type)
; AVP: RAT-Type
; Command: Connection-Management-Request
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-1
; Page: 23
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present if the request is for a T6a/b connection establishment or for a T6a/b connection update."
    present-if Connection-Action = CONNECTION_ESTABLISHMENT


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#cmr-visited-plmn-id)
; AVP: Visited-PLMN-Id
; Command: Connection-Management-Request
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-1
; Page: 23
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present if the request is for a T6a/b connection establishment or for a T6a/b connection update."
    present-if Connection-Action = CONNECTION_ESTABLISHMENT


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#cmr-terminal-information)
; AVP: Terminal-Information
; Command: Connection-Management-Request
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-1
; Page: 23
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"This Information Element shall contain the identity of the UE. It shall be present if available."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#cma-5-7-1-experimental-result-vendor)
; AVP: Experimental-Result
; Command: Connection-Management-Answer
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-2
; Page: 23
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"Experimental-Result AVP shall be used for T6a/b errors. This is a grouped AVP, which contains the 3GPP Vendor ID in the Vendor-Id AVP, and the error code in the Experimental-Result-Code AVP."
    requires Experimental-Result/Vendor-Id = 10415


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#cma-pdn-connection-charging-id)
; AVP: PDN-Connection-Charging-ID
; Command: Connection-Management-Answer
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-2
; Page: 23
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"shall be present if the answer is for a T6a/b connection establishment."
    present-if request/Connection-Action = CONNECTION_ESTABLISHMENT and Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#cma-extended-pco)
; AVP: Extended-PCO
; Command: Connection-Management-Answer
; Section: 5.7.1
; Table: 5.7.1-2
; Page: 23
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"This Information Element shall be present, if the SCEF needs to send Extended PCO information to the UE."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.128.dadx#cmr-serving-plmn-rate-control)
; AVP: Serving-PLMN-Rate-Control
; Command: Connection-Management-Request
; Section: 5.7.2
; Page: 25
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.2.0
"- if Serving PLMN Rate Control is configured, the MME shall include the Serving PLMN Rate Control information"
    text-only


